<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila Mining H1 net at 43 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Manila Mining H1 net at 43 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover	   351 vs 547</p>
<p>    Net income	  43 vs 239</p>
<p>Note: Full name Manila Mining Corp. The firm said net profit was sharply lower than last year due to lower gold output following reduced milling tonnage and low head grades. As a result production costs rose to $340 per ounce of gold this year from $197 per ounce in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
</text>
